<title>INDIA: Indian October CPI up 8.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian October CPI up 8.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's annual rate of inflation as measured by the consumer price index (CPI) was 8.5 percent in October 1996, the government said on Saturday.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	   Oct 96   Sep 96   Oct 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	+8.5     +8.5    +10.4</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1982)     346	344	319</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary.</p>
</text>
